id: pm-s5e04g
title: "Graph wave: reconstruct evidence, incident, release, and package relationships from immutable history and linked resources"
description: "Reconstruct typed evidence, incident, release, and package relationships from immutable history and linked resources through a reproducible, confidence-aware extractor."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 2
tags[7]: all-status,backfill,evidence,graph,history,provenance,relationships
created_at: "2026-07-24T23:48:08.571Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-29T21:22:40.344Z"
author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 2400
acceptance_criteria: "A reproducible extractor derives candidate edges from history messages, evidence comments, linked files, and linked test runs, emitting source and confidence for each; Only candidates whose source and confidence can be stated are materialised; unexplainable candidates are logged to an uncertainty ledger, never written; Derived edges carry the derivation source so a later correction can supersede rather than silently overwrite; Terminal items are touched only inside a dedicated changelog-safe batch, with the changelog effect measured and regenerated last; Re-running the extractor is idempotent: no duplicate edges, no timestamp churn on unchanged items"
goal: explainable-graph
objective: Relationships that already exist implicitly in history and linked artifacts become explicit typed edges
value: "The workspace already records which pull request closed which item, which nightly failure produced which issue, which release shipped which change, and which file each item touched — but only as prose in history messages and comments, where no graph algorithm can reach it."
impact: "Roughly doubles the semantic edge supply without a single judgement call, because every edge is derived from an immutable record rather than inferred from similarity."
outcome: "Typed verifies, discovered_from, incident_from, and release-association edges are materialised from history entries, linked files, and evidence comments, each carrying its derivation source."
why_now: "The reconstruction wave is declared in the plan strategy but has no task, and the raw material is already immutable — derivation is reproducible and safe to re-run, unlike judgement-based enrichment."
parent: pm-a8zm
risk: medium
confidence: medium
