  pm-a8zm,implements,"2026-07-26T05:55:02.922Z"
body: "## Latent relationships available today\nPull-request lanes record which change closed which items, in history messages and in evidence comments. Nightly failures record which leg produced which issue. Linked files record which items share a source region. Linked test runs record which item a run verified. Scanner imports record which finding produced which triage batch. All of it is already immutable and none of it is a graph edge.\n\n## Derivation, not inference\nEvery edge this wave writes must trace to a specific immutable record. Similarity, co-occurrence, and title heuristics are out of scope — those produce plausible edges, and a plausible edge is worse than a missing one because it survives review by looking reasonable.\n\n## Ordering\nRuns after the baseline and the legacy hygiene batch so it is not writing edges into a structure that is about to be cleaned. Feeds the reachability profile, which can then measure real depth rather than depth inflated by noise.\n\n## Boundary\nNo generic density target. No automatic edge whose source and confidence cannot be explained."
